§ `ss 21, 23, 24 -- applying to the Supreme Court within 48 hours`

#ASSERT `s 21 -- can I still apply to the Supreme Court for an autopsy` TRUE TRUE TRUE 0 EQUALS `IN 48`
#ASSERT `s 21 -- can I still apply to the Supreme Court for an autopsy` TRUE TRUE TRUE 48 EQUALS `IN 48`
#ASSERT `s 21 -- can I still apply to the Supreme Court for an autopsy` TRUE TRUE TRUE 49 EQUALS `OUT 48`
#ASSERT `s 21 -- can I still apply to the Supreme Court for an autopsy` TRUE TRUE FALSE 100 EQUALS `48 NOT BEGUN`
#ASSERT `s 21 -- can I still apply to the Supreme Court for an autopsy` TRUE FALSE TRUE 10 EQUALS `NO REFUSAL`
#ASSERT `s 21 -- can I still apply to the Supreme Court for an autopsy` FALSE TRUE TRUE 10 EQUALS `NO REFUSAL`

#ASSERT `s 23 -- can I still apply to the Supreme Court to stop the autopsy` TRUE TRUE TRUE 47 EQUALS `IN 48`
#ASSERT `s 23 -- can I still apply to the Supreme Court to stop the autopsy` TRUE TRUE TRUE 48.5 EQUALS `OUT 48`
#ASSERT `s 23 -- can I still apply to the Supreme Court to stop the autopsy` TRUE TRUE FALSE 0 EQUALS `48 NOT BEGUN`
#ASSERT `s 23 -- can I still apply to the Supreme Court to stop the autopsy` TRUE FALSE TRUE 10 EQUALS `NO DECISION OR ORDER`
#ASSERT `s 23 -- can I still apply to the Supreme Court to stop the autopsy` FALSE TRUE TRUE 10 EQUALS `48 SNOK ONLY`

#ASSERT `s 24 -- can I still apply to the Supreme Court to stop the exhumation` TRUE TRUE TRUE 48 EQUALS `IN 48`
#ASSERT `s 24 -- can I still apply to the Supreme Court to stop the exhumation` TRUE TRUE TRUE 50 EQUALS `OUT 48`
#ASSERT `s 24 -- can I still apply to the Supreme Court to stop the exhumation` TRUE FALSE TRUE 10 EQUALS `NO DECISION OR ORDER`
#ASSERT `s 24 -- can I still apply to the Supreme Court to stop the exhumation` FALSE TRUE TRUE 10 EQUALS `48 SNOK ONLY`

