§ `Offences -- maximum penalties`

#ASSERT `the maximum fine in penalty units` `not reporting a reportable death you have reasonable grounds to believe has not been reported (s 12(2))` EQUALS 40
#ASSERT `the maximum fine in penalty units` `not giving the coroner information that may help, after reporting a death (s 13(1))` EQUALS 40
#ASSERT `the maximum fine in penalty units` `not complying with an undertaking given when a thing taken by the coroner was released (s 19(4) or s 33(4))` EQUALS 40
#ASSERT `the maximum fine in penalty units` `entering or interfering with a restricted disaster area without good reason (s 32(2))` EQUALS 40
#ASSERT `the maximum fine in penalty units` `not complying with a coroner's direction to give information, without reasonable excuse (s 36(2))` EQUALS 40
#ASSERT `the maximum fine in penalty units` `disobeying a coroner's summons, order or direction at an inquest (s 41(3))` EQUALS 40
#ASSERT `the maximum fine in penalty units` `publishing a report in breach of a non-publication order (s 43(2))` EQUALS 85
#ASSERT `the maximum fine in penalty units` `insulting a coroner, interrupting an inquest, or causing a disturbance in or near the place of an inquest (s 46)` EQUALS 40
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `not reporting a reportable death you have reasonable grounds to believe has not been reported (s 12(2))` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `not giving the coroner information that may help, after reporting a death (s 13(1))` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `not complying with an undertaking given when a thing taken by the coroner was released (s 19(4) or s 33(4))` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `entering or interfering with a restricted disaster area without good reason (s 32(2))` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `not complying with a coroner's direction to give information, without reasonable excuse (s 36(2))` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `disobeying a coroner's summons, order or direction at an inquest (s 41(3))` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `publishing a report in breach of a non-publication order (s 43(2))` EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `insulting a coroner, interrupting an inquest, or causing a disturbance in or near the place of an inquest (s 46)` EQUALS 6
